  "description": "⭐<strong> Fleurs de Villes DIANA in support of The Diana Award </strong><em>is the world-premiere fresh floral exhibition celebrating the life and enduring legacy of Diana, Princess of Wales, hosted at the renowned Somerset House in London.&nbsp;</em><br><br><strong><u>Highlights</u></strong><br> 🌸 Discover 15 one-of-a-kind fresh floral mannequins inspired by defining moments from Diana's life and the causes she championed.<br> 💐 Showcasing extraordinary floral artistry by London's leading floral designers, crafted from thousands of fresh flowers.<br> 🎟️ Presented in support of The Diana Award — a portion of every ticket supports young changemakers worldwide.<br> 📸 Capture memories at interactive selfie moments and vote for your favourite floral masterpiece<em>.</em><br> 🌍 Don't miss the world-premiere of this spectacular exhibition.<br><br><strong><u>General Info</u></strong><br> 📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br> ⏳ Duration: Approximately 40 to 50 minutes<br> 📍 Location: East Wing Galleries, Somerset House, Strand, London WC2R 1LA<br> 👤 Age requirement: All ages<br> ♿ Accessibility: This exhibition is accessible<br> ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://www.fleursdevilles.com/fdv-diana-faq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br> ⏰ Opening hours:<br><ul><li>Sun to Wed: 9.30am – 7pm (Last entry 6.15pm)</li><li>Thurs to Sat: 9.30am – 8pm (Last entry 7.15pm)</li><li><em>Except: Wed 16 Sep (12pm – 8pm) + Sat 19 Sep (9:30am – 7pm) </em></li></ul><br><strong><u>Description﻿</u></strong><br> Global flower show sensation<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://partners.feverup.com/www.fleursdevilles.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Fleurs de Villes</strong></a> arrives in London for the world premiere of <strong>Fleurs de Villes DIANA in support of The Diana Award</strong>, where leading British floral designers reimagine some of Diana, Princess of Wales' most iconic looks as fifteen spectacular fresh floral mannequins.<br><br> Behind every one-of-a-kind floral masterpiece is a remarkable story — from her groundbreaking HIV/AIDS advocacy and humanitarian work to diplomatic tours and her landmark walk through an Angolan minefield. Together, they celebrate how Diana used fashion to connect with people, inspire compassion, and champion the causes she cared about.<br><br> Beyond the floral mannequins, enjoy more spectacular floral installations that will fill the East Wing Galleries with colour, fragrance and artistry. Explore interactive floral moments, capture unforgettable photos and vote for your favourite floral masterpiece.<br><br><strong>Presented in support of The Diana Award </strong>— the charity established in her memory and inspired by her belief&nbsp;that young people have the power to change the world — a portion of every ticket sold helps fund programmes empowering the next generation of changemakers.<br><br><strong>Come for the flowers. Leave inspired.</strong><br><br><strong><u>Enhance your Experience</u></strong><br> Complete your visit with one of our exclusive dining or floral workshop experiences at Somerset House, with partial proceeds supporting The Diana Award.<br><br><strong>*Fleurs de Villes DIANA Set Menu – Aram by Imad</strong> (£50 per person)<br> Enjoy a special set menu at Somerset House's acclaimed Eastern Mediterranean restaurant<br><em> Served daily. </em><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fRTnhYroaRucQMekUwD-Dd4k0DyMSVIa/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong><em><u>View Menu</u></em></strong></a><em> | </em><a href=\"http://opentable.co.uk/r/aram-reservations-london?restref=441834&amp;lang=en-GB&amp;ot_source=Restaurant%20website\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong><em><u>Reserve a Table</u></em></strong></a><br><br><strong>*Fleurs de Villes DIANA Afternoon Tea – Café Petiole</strong> (£47 per person)<br> Enjoy a special Afternoon Tea at Somerset House’s elegant Café Petiole.<br><em>Served Thursday to Saturday at </em><strong><em>3:00pm</em></strong><em>. </em><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LhWXsk22ZFKL0IDlX9zwQ7EF8o559DMo/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong><em><u>View Menu</u></em></strong></a><br><br><strong>*Fleurs de Villes Floral Workshop </strong>(£95 per person)<br> Join one of our expert Fleurs de Villes floral designers for a hands-on workshop, where you'll create your own beautiful bouquet or floral arrangement while learning professional floristry techniques to use at home. Includes a glass of sparkling wine or non-alcoholic beverage.<br> Duration: Approx. 75 minutes&nbsp;<br><em> Sessions: Mon–Fri: 1pm | Sat–Sun: 11am &amp; 1pm</em><br>",
